  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n P\n Q\n R\n S\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ×\n ÷\n +\n -\n \n \n\n**So, checking each option one by one:**\n\nOption 1) 24 R 4 P 2 S 6 Q 2 = 28 ⇒ 24 + 4 × 2 - 6 ÷ 2 = 28\n\n⇒ 24 + 4 × 2 - __**6 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 28\n\n⇒ 24 + __**4 **____**×**____** 2**__ - 3 = 28\n\n⇒ __**24 + 8**__ - 3 = 28\n\n⇒ __**3**____**2 - 3**__ = 28\n\n⇒ 29 ≠ 28 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 10 P 2 S 5 R 5 = 20 ⇒ 10 × 2 - 5 + 5 = 20\n\n⇒ __**10 **____**×**____** 2**__ - 5 + 5 = 20\n\n⇒ __**20**____** + 5**__ - 5 = 20\n\n⇒ __**25 - 5**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) 15 Q 3 R 4 P 2 S 1 = 12 ⇒ 15 ÷ 3 + 4 × 2 - 1 = 12\n\n⇒ __**15 ÷ 3**__ + 4 × 2 - 1 = 12\n\n⇒ 5 + __**4 **____**×**____** 2**__ - 1 = 12\n\n⇒ __**5**____** + 8**__ - 1 = 12\n\n⇒ __**13**____** - 1**__ = 12\n\n⇒ 12 = 12 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) 12 S 2 R 6 Q 2 P 3 = 19 ⇒ 12 - 2 + 6 ÷ 2 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 12 - 2 + __**6 **____**÷**____** 2**__ × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 12 - 2 + __**3**____** ×**____** 3**__ = 19\n\n⇒ __**12 + 9**__ - 2 = 19\n\n⇒ __**21**____** -**____** 2**__ = 19\n\n⇒ 19 = 19 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
